      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1748,
        "height": 580,
        "content": "## 1. Receive and sort the message\nEvery WhatsApp message hits one webhook. The system prompt is loaded from a data table, then customer messages and your own outgoing messages are prepared differently so the agent sees both sides."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "efe16f71-b30b-4cb5-b5be-1600fcefafd7",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Section 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3328,
        -832
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1068,
        "height": 844,
        "content": "## 2. Write the reply\nThe agent gets this week's calendar and five tools: look up events by date, list all events, read an image, match an Instagram ad, and save a booking. It returns whether to reply, the text, and an optional image."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
